# Memory Bank Context

## Required Reading

Before starting any task, check these memory-bank files for context:

| File | When to Read |
|------|--------------|
| `gotrading/memory-bank/activeContext.md` | Always - current focus |
| `gotrading/memory-bank/progress.md` | For migration status |
| `gotrading/memory-bank/available-agents.md` | To know what agents can help |

## Available Agents

Custom agents are defined in `.cursor/agents/`. Use them via Task tool:

| Agent | Use For |
|-------|---------|
| `ui-migration` | Porting components from algo-desk-central |
| `backend-endpoint` | Creating new API endpoints (full stack) |
| `api-hook-generator` | Creating React Query hooks |
| `broker-adapter` | Adding new broker integrations |
| `shadcn-component` | Adding/porting UI components |
| `architecture-audit` | Fixing critical architecture issues |
| `test-scaffold` | Generating test files |
| `migration-sync` | Syncing with Lovable updates |

## Key Context Files

```
gotrading/memory-bank/
├── activeContext.md       # Current work focus
├── progress.md            # Overall progress tracking
├── available-agents.md    # Agent capabilities index
├── antigravity-rules.md   # Development constraints
├── component-migration-plan.md
├── ui-migration-plan.md
├── techContext.md
├── systemPatterns.md
├── projectbrief.md
└── productContext.md
```

## Usage Pattern

1. **Starting a task:** Read `activeContext.md` and `progress.md`
2. **Complex task:** Check `available-agents.md` for helpful agents
3. **UI work:** Read `component-migration-plan.md`
4. **Backend work:** Read `techContext.md` and `systemPatterns.md`
5. **After completing:** Update `progress.md`

## Update Requirements

After completing significant work:
- Update `progress.md` with completed items
- Update `activeContext.md` if focus changes
- Note any blockers or decisions made
